  "html": "<div class=\"task note-list\"><h3>Questions 1–10</h3><p class=\"instructions\">Complete the form. Write <strong>NO MORE THAN TWO WORDS AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p><h4 class=\"task-title\">Bakewell Travel: Customer Booking Request Form</h4><div class=\"form-row \"><strong>Example</strong></div><div class=\"form-grid\"><div class=\"form-row \">Travelling to:</div><div class=\"form-row \">Dubai</div><div class=\"form-row \">Name:</div><div class=\"form-row \">Sarah Carter</div><div class=\"form-row \">Contact phone number:</div><div class=\"form-row \"><input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"1\" id=\"q1\" name=\"q1\" placeholder=\"1\" aria-label=\"Question 1\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"></div><div class=\"form-row \">Best day to call:</div><div class=\"form-row \"><input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"2\" id=\"q2\" name=\"q2\" placeholder=\"2\" aria-label=\"Question 2\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> morning</div><div class=\"form-row \">Number of people travelling:</div><div class=\"form-row \"><input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"3\" id=\"q3\" name=\"q3\" placeholder=\"3\" aria-label=\"Question 3\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"></div><div class=\"form-row \">Date of outward journey:</div><div class=\"form-row \"><input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"4\" id=\"q4\" name=\"q4\" placeholder=\"4\" aria-label=\"Question 4\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"></div><div class=\"form-row \">Day of return journey:</div><div class=\"form-row \">25 November</div><div class=\"form-row \">Purpose of trip:</div><div class=\"form-row \">a <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"5\" id=\"q5\" name=\"q5\" placeholder=\"5\" aria-label=\"Question 5\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"></div><div class=\"form-row \">Special requirements:</div><div class=\"form-row \">one passenger can’t eat <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"6\" id=\"q6\" name=\"q6\" placeholder=\"6\" aria-label=\"Question 6\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"></div></div><div class=\"form-row section-heading\">Market Research</div><div class=\"form-row \">Number of trips in last 12 months: six</div><div class=\"form-grid\"><div class=\"form-row \">Last country visited:</div><div class=\"form-row \"><input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"7\" id=\"q7\" name=\"q7\" placeholder=\"7\" aria-label=\"Question 7\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"></div><div class=\"form-row \">Purpose of last foreign trip:</div><div class=\"form-row \"><input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"8\" id=\"q8\" name=\"q8\" placeholder=\"8\" aria-label=\"Question 8\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"></div><div class=\"form-row \">Customer feedback on website:</div><div class=\"form-row \">too <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"9\" id=\"q9\" name=\"q9\" placeholder=\"9\" aria-label=\"Question 9\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"></div><div class=\"form-row \">Email address:</div><div class=\"form-row \">carter.s@<input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"10\" id=\"q10\" name=\"q10\" placeholder=\"10\" aria-label=\"Question 10\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\">.com</div></div></div>",
